---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | Dear Result Live (আমাদের সম্পর্কে)"
  description="Learn about Dear Result Live (dearresultlive.in), an independent 3rd-party public utility service providing fast, accurate Nagaland & Sikkim Dear Lottery results."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-8 text-slate-300">
    
    <div class="border-b border-slate-800 pb-6">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest">Public Utility Service</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white mt-1">
        About Dear Result Live (আমাদের সম্পর্কে)
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-2">
        Independent information engine publishing daily official Nagaland and Sikkim State Lottery Sambad results.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Our Mission</h2>
        <p>
          <strong>Dear Result Live (dearresultlive.in)</strong> was established to provide a clean, high-speed, and reliable public utility platform for citizens to check officially declared Nagaland, Sikkim, and West Bengal Dear State Lottery results without intrusive ads, misleading popups, or delays.
        </p>
        <p>
          We publish verified lottery draw numbers for all three daily draws: <strong>1:00 PM Morning (দুপুর ১টা)</strong>, <strong>6:00 PM Day (সন্ধ্যা ৬টা)</strong>, and <strong>8:00 PM Night (রাত ৮টা)</strong> immediately after their official declaration by the State Lottery Directorate.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Editorial & Verification Standards</h2>
        <p>
          Every winning number displayed on our portal is parsed and cross-checked directly against the official Government Gazette publications released by the Directorate of Nagaland State Lotteries and Directorate of Sikkim State Lotteries. We provide direct access to the scanned official JPG sheets and signed Gazette PDFs so players can verify their tickets with 100% confidence.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-amber-500/30 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-2">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-amber-400 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>🛡️</span>
          <span>Important Regulatory Advisory</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          Dear Result Live is an independent informational and reporting portal. We are <strong>not affiliated with, authorized, endorsed, or operated</strong> by the Government of Nagaland, Government of Sikkim, Government of West Bengal, or any lottery distributor. We <strong>do not sell lottery tickets</strong>, accept bets, process payments, or promote gambling in any form. Lottery participation is restricted to adults aged 18+ in legal jurisdictions only.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
